=2 Walkthrough
* Examine the **Crawling Cave** at (F-11) In {z:Kamihr Drifts} for a long cutscene.
** To reach the west side of the map, head through the cave in the northwest of (G-10).
*** Bivouac #2 is the closest. From the Waypoint, exit the cave via the west tunnel. Turn right and head north until you reach an inlet at the northernmost point of (G-10). Go down the slope and through the cave. Then, travel southwest until you see a "Crawling Cave" target point (it is in the southwest-leading path on the map) and click it.
